      "label": "logger",
      "title": "The Logger's contract",
      "description": "The contract a Logger keeps: accept a complete log message, record it unchanged where a person can read it, attributed to the actor the message names. A mechanical Actor plays this Role; this is what it must do, and what it can be tested against.",
